"15\" fill=\"#827b70\" letter-spacing=\"2\">RESEARCH</text>\n    <text x=\"380\" y=\"796\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#383630\" >AI-assisted writing</text>\n    <text x=\"380\" y=\"847\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#383630\" >An AI draft can shape</text>\n    <rect x=\"375\" y=\"861\" width=\"329\" height=\"32\" fill=\"#e9dfca\" />\n    <text x=\"380\" y=\"885\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#383630\" >what a writer thinks next,</text>\n    <text x=\"380\" y=\"923\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#383630\" >while other ideas are</text>\n    <text x=\"380\" y=\"961\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#383630\" >still taking shape.</text>\n  </g></g><g class=\"archive-assemble\" data-piece=\"visitor-question\" style=\"--piece-x:0px;--piece-y:12px;--piece-r:0deg;--piece-delay:1750ms\"><text x=\"960\" y=\"207\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#827b70\" letter-spacing=\"2\">YOUR QUESTION</text>\n    <text x=\"960\" y=\"256\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"35\" fill=\"#383630\" >What do Henry’s interests</text>\n    <text x=\"960\" y=\"302\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"35\" fill=\"#383630\" >have in common?</text>\n    <path d=\"M961 332H1439\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c5b69c\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/></g><path class=\"archive-thread\" style=\"--piece-delay:2050ms\" d=\"M682 519C850 519 869 546 929 600\" pathLength=\"1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#9a8058\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><path class=\"archive-thread\" style=\"--piece-delay:2250ms\" d=\"M716 879C864 879 891 827 945 781\" pathLength=\"1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#9a8058\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><g class=\"archive-assemble\" data-piece=\"reading-sheet\" style=\"--piece-x:22px;--piece-y:8px;--piece-r:0deg;--piece-delay:2800ms\"><g transform=\"rotate(1.5 1172 649)\">\n    <g filter=\"url(#__ID__paper-shadow)\"><rect x=\"905\" y=\"400\" width=\"593\" height=\"598\" fill=\"url(#__ID__vellum)\" /></g>\n    <path transform=\"translate(941 438)\" d=\"M12 0C14 8 16 10 24 12C16 14 14 16 12 24C10 16 8 14 0 12C8 10 10 8 12 0Z\" fill=\"#9a8058\"/><text x=\"978\" y=\"459\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#383630\" >AI connects the material</text>\n    <path d=\"M940 489h518\" stroke=\"#d8d1c5\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n    <text x=\"940\" y=\"532\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#827b70\" letter-spacing=\"1.5\">PHOTOGRAPHY × RESEARCH</text>\n    <text x=\"940\" y=\"587\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"37\" fill=\"#383630\" >Tools shape what</text>\n    <text x=\"940\" y=\"635\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"37\" fill=\"#383630\" >we notice and pursue.</text>\n    <text x=\"940\" y=\"698\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#625c51\" >A lens brings some details into view.</text>\n    <text x=\"940\" y=\"734\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#625c51\" >An AI draft makes some ideas easier</text>\n    <text x=\"940\" y=\"770\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#625c51\" >to follow. Both shape what happens next.</text>\n    <text x=\"940\" y=\"829\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#625c51\" >His hobby and his research share a</text>\n    <text x=\"940\" y=\"865\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#625c51\" >concern with how tools guide attention</text>\n    <text x=\"940\" y=\"901\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#625c51\" >and thought.</text>\n    <text x=\"940\" y=\"967\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#9a8058\" >An interpretation across two parts of Henry’s life</text>\n  </g></g><g class=\"archive-assemble\" data-piece=\"self-understanding\" style=\"--piece-x:0px;--piece-y:12px;--piece-r:0deg;--piece-delay:3550ms\"><text x=\"800\" y=\"1084\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"40\" fill=\"#383630\" text-anchor=\"middle\">A new connection. Another way to see myself.</text>\n    <text x=\"800\" y=\"1129\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#827b70\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Other people’s questions can change how I understand my own archive.</text></g>"
